Recommends: fonts-liberation
Description: fast PDF viewer for GNOME that can fill in and sign forms
 Acrimonious Reader is a PDF viewer built with GTK 4 and libadwaita. Pages
 render on a background thread with Poppler, so scrolling and zooming stay
 smooth even in large documents.
 .
 It has page thumbnails, the document outline, search across the whole
 document, links with back and forward, text selection, night mode, printing
 and automatic reloading when the file changes. Text boxes and freehand
 drawing are saved into the PDF as standard annotations, for filling in and
 signing forms.
